
==========================
 * From theorem premises:
A B C D E F G H : Points
DC ∥ AB [00]
DB ∥ CA [01]
A,B,E are collinear [02]
D,F,C are collinear [03]
FE ∥ CA [04]
G,E,C are collinear [05]
A,G,F are collinear [06]
