B,H,F are collinear [08]

 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. D,C,F are collinear [03] & A,B,E are collinear [02] & CD ∥ AB [00] ⇒  FC ∥ AE [09]
002. FC ∥ AE [09] & G,E,C are collinear [05] & A,G,F are collinear [06] ⇒  CF:EA = GC:GE [10]
003. A,B,E are collinear [02] & D,F,C are collinear [03] & AB ∥ CD [00] & EF ∥ AC [04] ⇒  ∠AEF = ∠FCA [11]
004. EF ∥ AC [04] ⇒  ∠AFE = ∠FAC [12]
005. ∠AEF = ∠FCA [11] & ∠AFE = ∠FAC [12] (Similar Triangles)⇒  AE = FC [13]
006. G,E,C are collinear [05] & CF:EA = GC:GE [10] & AE = FC [13] ⇒  G is midpoint of EC [14]
007. C,F,D are collinear [03] & A,B,E are collinear [02] & CD ∥ AB [00] ⇒  DF ∥ EB [15]
008. DF ∥ EB [15] & H,E,D are collinear [07] & B,H,F are collinear [08] ⇒  DF:EB = HD:HE [16]
009. A,B,E are collinear [02] & D,C,F are collinear [03] & AB ∥ CD [00] & EF ∥ AC [04] & BD ∥ AC [01] ⇒  ∠EBD = ∠DFE [17]
010. EF ∥ AC [04] & BD ∥ AC [01] ⇒  ∠EDB = ∠DEF [18]
011. ∠EBD = ∠DFE [17] & ∠EDB = ∠DEF [18] (Similar Triangles)⇒  EB = DF [19]
012. H,E,D are collinear [07] & DF:EB = HD:HE [16] & EB = DF [19] ⇒  H is midpoint of ED [20]
013. G is midpoint of EC [14] & H is midpoint of ED [20] ⇒  GH ∥ CD
==========================
